 # Implement tattler_receive cooperative interruption tool
 
 Register a Tattler-level receive tool that the model can call when pending messages may affect current work. The tool should have concise prompt guidance, a call renderer that says the agent is checking pending messages / ending the current turn, a quiet result renderer, provider-safe result content, and terminate=true. It should set state for agent_end to schedule the receive turn.
 
